      "short": "$8\\frac{3}{20}\\text{ km}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}2\\frac{1}{4}+5\\frac{2}{5}+\\frac{1}{2}&=\\frac{9}{4}+\\frac{27}{5}+\\frac{1}{2}\\\\&=\\frac{45}{20}+\\frac{108}{20}+\\frac{10}{20}\\\\&=\\frac{163}{20}\\\\&=8\\frac{3}{20}\\text{ km}\\end{align*}$$",
